    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_01",
      "hash64": "5C51C3C3E118F228",
      "text": "¡Bienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa a la villa, estudiante de Paldea!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_02",
      "hash64": "5C51C6C3E118F741",
      "text": "En el albergue de Noroteo, entre otras cosas,\\nactuamos como oficina de turismo.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_03",
      "hash64": "5C51C5C3E118F58E",
      "text": "Cuando accedes a la Bolsa y demás menús a\\ntravés de tu SmartRotom, el tema del borde\\r\\nsuperior e inferior cambia según tu localización,\\r\\n¿te habías fijado?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_09",
      "hash64": "5C51BBC3E118E490",
      "text": "Si quieres configurar el tema de los menús de\\ntu SmartRotom, no tienes más que decírmelo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_04",
